    <description>Guided New Opportunity (Stage 1) screen flow. Collects the Stage-1 mandatory fields and creates the Opportunity. Opportunity Name is intentionally omitted and auto-generated by the before-save naming flow. Overrides the standard New action. v1</description>
    <dynamicChoiceSets>
        <name>PCS_BookingBucket</name>
